            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Portfolix v0.1.12 (Build 25)

- 修复 Agent 分析中证据校验误判导致的报错与回退。
- 改善分析自动修复和失败诊断。
- 更新持仓时，自动换算的成本价最多保留 8 位小数。

## What's New

- Fixed incorrect evidence validation causing Agent analysis failures and fallback.
- Improved automatic report repair and failure diagnostics.
- Limited calculated unit costs in holding updates to 8 decimal places.

Apple Silicon · macOS 15+
